---
// Figma node 52:76
---

<section class="story" id="story">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="h2 story__title">
            The story of many aspiring property owners...
        </h2>

        <div class="split">
            <article class="narrative">
                <p class="lead">
                    Meet someone who has always wanted to own a property in
                    Lekki.
                </p>
                <p class="body">
                    They have a good job, they're building their finances and
                    they're doing their best to secure their future. Every now
                    and then, they check property listings. They see beautiful
                    apartments. They imagine what life would look like in their
                    own home.
                </p>
                <p class="reality">
                    But every time they check the price, reality hits.
                </p>

                <ul class="prices" aria-label="Rising property prices">
                    <li>₦50 million</li>
                    <li class="p2">₦70 million</li>
                    <li class="p3">₦100M+</li>
                </ul>

                <blockquote class="quotes">
                    <p>“Maybe next year.”</p>
                    <p>“Let me save a little more.”</p>
                    <p>“I'll buy when I have enough.”</p>
                </blockquote>

                <div class="truth">
                    <p class="truth__kicker">But here’s the problem</p>
                    <h3 class="truth__title">
                        The perfect financial moment may never come.
                    </h3>
                    <p class="truth__body">
                        And while you're waiting to accumulate the entire
                        purchase price, opportunities to enter the property
                        market may change.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <p class="pivot">
                    But what if you could start differently? What if you didn't
                    have to put together the entire purchase price before taking
                    your first step? That's where Capital Heights comes in.
                </p>

                <a class="btn" href="#intro" data-lead>
                    Discover a different way to start owning property
                </a>
            </article>

            <div class="photo">
                <img
                    src="/images/evening_dusk.jpg"
                    width="512"
                    height="225"
                    loading="lazy"
                    alt="Capital Heights evening dusk view with illuminated balconies"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .story {
        background: var(--bg);
        padding: 96px 0;
    }
    .story__title {
        max-width: 768px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .split {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 40px;
        padding-top: 56px;
    }
    .narrative {
        grid-column: 1 / span 7;
        align-self: start;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: var(--surface);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    }
    .lead {
        font: 400 18px/29.25px var(--sans);
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .body {
        font: 400 16px/26px var(--sans);
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .reality {
        font: italic 600 22px/30px var(--serif);
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .prices {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 8px;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .prices li {
        padding: 16px 16px 18px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: var(--bg-deep);
        font: 700 22px/30px var(--sans);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text);
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .prices .p2 {
        color: var(--peach);
    }
    .prices .p3 {
        color: var(--gold);
    }

    .quotes {
        margin: 0;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 8px 0 0 18px;
        border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        font: italic 400 16px/24px var(--sans);
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .truth {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        padding: 32px 24px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--surface-4);
    }
    .truth__kicker {
        font: 600 12px/16px var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--gold);
    }
    .truth__title {
        font: 700 22px/30px var(--serif);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .truth__body {
        font: 400 16px/24px var(--sans);
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .pivot {
        padding-top: 8px;
        font: 500 18px/28px var(--sans);
        color: var(--gold);
    }
    .narrative .btn {
        box-shadow:
            0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
            0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .photo {
        grid-column: 8 / span 5;
        align-self: center;
        height: 575px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: var(--surface);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-img);
    }
    .photo img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .split {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 32px;
            padding-top: 40px;
        }
        .narrative,
        .photo {
            grid-column: 1;
        }
        .photo {
            height: auto;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            order: -1;
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .story {
            padding: 64px 0;
        }
        .narrative {
            padding: 24px 20px;
        }
        .lead {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 27px;
        }
        .reality {
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 28px;
        }
        .prices li {
            padding: 12px 6px 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 22px;
        }
        .truth {
            padding: 24px 20px 20px;
        }
        .truth__title {
            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 26px;
        }
        .pivot {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 26px;
        }
        .narrative .btn {
            width: 100%;
        }
    }
</style>
